        <span class="eyebrow">Common Questions</span>
        <h2>What Omaha Customers Ask Before Booking</h2>

        <div style="display:grid; gap:0.9rem; margin-top:2.2rem;">
          <details style="background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden;">
            <summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:1.2rem 1.4rem; font-weight:600; font-size:1.02rem; position:relative; color:var(--charcoal);">
              Do you offer mattress cleaning in West Omaha and Elkhorn?
              <span style="position:absolute; right:1.3rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:var(--gold-dark); font-size:1.3rem;">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div style="padding: 0 1.4rem 1.3rem; color:var(--stone); font-size:0.98rem; line-height:1.6;">
              Yes. We serve West Omaha, Elkhorn, Papillion, La Vista, Bellevue and the rest of Douglas and Sarpy counties, plus Council Bluffs. If you are unsure whether your address falls within our routing, <a href="/book" style="color:var(--charcoal); font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px;">send us your location</a> and we will confirm.
            </div>
